  "statSections": [
    {
      "name": "Actions",
      "rulesText": "Multiattack. The pirate makes three attacks, using Rapier or Pistol in any combination.\n\nRapier. Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Piercing damage, and the pirate has Advantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of this turn.\n\nPistol. Ranged Attack Roll: +7, range 30/90 ft. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) Piercing damage.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.186",
        "heading": "Actions",
        "lineStart": 23687,
        "lineEnd": 23693
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Bonus Actions",
      "rulesText": "Captain's Charm. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 14, one creature the pirate can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Charmed condition until the start of the pirate's next turn.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.186",
        "heading": "Bonus Actions",
        "lineStart": 23695,
        "lineEnd": 23697
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Reactions",
      "rulesText": "Riposte. Trigger: The pirate is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The pirate adds 3 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss. On a miss, the pirate makes one Rapier attack against the triggering creature if within range.",
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
        "section": "12.186",
        "heading": "Reactions",
        "lineStart": 23699,
        "lineEnd": 23701
      }
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Medium or Small Humanoid, Neutral\n\nAC 17\nInitiative +7 (17)\nHP 84 (13d8 + 26)\nSpeed 30 ft.\n\nSkills Acrobatics +7, Perception +5\nGear Pistol, Rapier\nSenses Passive Perception 15\nLanguages Common plus one other language\nCR 6 (XP 2,300; PB +3)\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The pirate makes three attacks, using Rapier or Pistol in any combination.\n\nRapier. Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Piercing damage, and the pirate has Advantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of this turn.\n\nPistol. Ranged Attack Roll: +7, range 30/90 ft. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) Piercing damage.\n\nBonus Actions\n\nCaptain's Charm. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 14, one creature the pirate can see within 30 feet. Failure: The target has the Charmed condition until the start of the pirate's next turn.\n\nReactions\n\nRiposte. Trigger: The pirate is hit by a melee attack roll while holding a weapon. Response: The pirate adds 3 to its AC against that attack, possibly causing it to miss. On a miss, the pirate makes one Rapier attack against the triggering creature if within range.",
